6.2 Governance Verification PostureAll public submissions transmitted via FISP POST endpoints enter a staging sandbox. The central repository server passes the shared module code directly through the SDOA Probation Officer verification gate. If the incoming file violates the 500-line maximum limit or utilizes prohibited global mutations (like bypassing the StateStore for standard global variables), the platform auto-rejects the proposal before human review. Approved contributions are transformed into formal GitHub Pull Requests, safely expanding the shared SDOA portfolio.  